# Cursor Rules
- Always read `docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md` first.
- Recreate / operate from `docs/RUNBOOK.md`.
- Log sessions in `docs/PROGRESS.md`. App facts in `docs/settings/`.
- GitHub: https://github.com/ixamal/stems — docs + `py/` helpers. Never commit audio, stems, NML, TSI, or master.db.
- Git authorship: David alone. No `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor trailer.
- Do not change Traktor / NUO-STEMS / Audio MIDI Setup without a documented rollback.

# Rig
- Machine: David / Mac (Apple Silicon), host `ix`
- NUO-STEMS 4 on the same Mac as Traktor Pro 4.5.1
- Default NUO mode: Traktor Pro 4 Native
- Library organize lives in https://github.com/ixamal/music_migration
- Mixer / BlackHole lives in https://github.com/ixamal/blackhole — different repo, different chat

# Phases
1. Native mode. Prove one track in Traktor.
2. Batch the playing crate.
3. Stretch: DAW splits for Maschine only if David asks.

# Journal
- Narrative → docs/PROGRESS.md; architecture → docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md; how-to → docs/RUNBOOK.md.
